// The shape each image model wears behind its card. Every mark starts from the
// picture that model is known by - its published logo or card art, kept through
// the refs door - and is redrawn through the doors of one of the two image
// models this machine has room for, then cleaned to a silhouette: the field it
// stood on dropped, the shape cropped and shrunk to 128, its dark parts carried
// as alpha. The turbo Qwen card's mark is the family mark with a drawn lightning
// bolt cut out of it. The page only places the shape and paints it in the card's
// own ink, so it reads as a watermark at any theme. The asks that made these are
// written up in plan.md.
